WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.918
A raw file is flexible but Spark may need to infer
or be given the

00:00:03.945 --> 00:00:09.558
schema A curated Delta table has a stronger table
contract

00:00:11.295 --> 00:00:17.018
For teaching think of raw files as ingestion
material and tables as reusable analytical assets

00:00:17.942 --> 00:00:21.350
That is not an absolute rule but it is a helpful
workflow
